        sources: [panel, 'public/scripts/scratchpad/swipes.js'], anchors: ['MAX_REPLY_SWIPES = 50', 'Reply prefills', 'Kimi K3 / K3.1 partial prefill'],
        content: 'Try again keeps the previous Scratchpad answer as a saved version instead of discarding it. Use the arrows and version counter below the reply to select an alternative, with up to 50 versions per reply. Try again works on any reply to one of your messages, not only the latest; later messages stay as they are. Context → Reply prefills has Reply prefill for text the model continues from, applying to every assistant in this session and new reply versions. Leave it empty for ordinary replies; the connection must support prefills. Kimi K3 / K3.1 partial prefill takes precedence for those models. Start with <think> to seed thinking; an unclosed <think> seeds thinking only and is not added to the saved reply.',
