        sources: [panel, 'public/scripts/scratchpad/html-preview.js'], anchors: ['Preview HTML/CSS', 'Static preview only.', 'No HTML block was included'],
        content: 'Choose Preview HTML/CSS beside a reply code block to see its HTML with the CSS blocks in that reply. The button also appears in supported proposed-text reviews. CSS without HTML uses sample content. This is a static preview: scripts, external resources and links are blocked, macros stay as written, and nothing is saved. Close preview returns to the discussion or review. Saving a proposed change still needs the separate Save change action.',
